"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">un solo para piano</span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">a violin <span class=\"rf\">solo </span></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">un solo de violín</span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">a piano <span class=\"rf\">solo </span></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">un solo de piano</span></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">to perform a <span class=\"rf\">solo </span></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">ejecutar un solo </span></span></span></span><span id=\"e_b-en-es0045649.004\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"gp sn ty_label tg_semb\">2 </span><span class=\"cnt\">uncountable </span><span class=\"hvg\"><span class=\"hv\">solo whist </span></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span d:def=\"1\" class=\"trans\">whist <span class=\"tgr\"><span class=\"gp tg_tgr\">(</span>masculine<span class=\"gp tg_tgr\">) </span></span><d:def></d:def></span><span class=\"gl\"><span class=\"gp tg_gl\">(</span>en el que cada uno de los cuatro jugadores se enfrenta a los otros tres<span class=\"gp tg_gl\">) </span></span></span></span></span><span id=\"e_b-en-es0045649.005\" class=\"gramb x_xd0 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"gp sn ty_label tg_gramb\">B </span><span d:pos=\"2\" class=\"ps\">adjective <d:pos></d:pos></span></span><span id=\"e_b-en-es0045649.007\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">1 </span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span class=\"lg\"><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">(</span><span class=\"fld\">Music</span><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">) </span></span><span class=\"co\"><span class=\"gp tg_co\">‹</span>violin<span class=\"gp tg_co\">, </span></span><span class=\"co\">voices<span class=\"gp tg_co\">› </span></span><span d:def=\"2\" class=\"trans\">solista <d:def></d:def></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span class=\"co\"><span class=\"gp tg_co\">‹</span>album<span class=\"gp tg_co\">› </span></span><span class=\"trans\">en solitario </span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span class=\"co\"><span class=\"gp tg_co\">‹</span>piece<span class=\"gp tg_co\">› </span></span><span class=\"trans\">para voz solista<span class=\"gp tg_tr\">, </span></span><span class=\"trans\">para instrumento solista </span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">to go <span class=\"rf\">solo </span></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">lanzarse como solista </span></span></span></span><span id=\"e_b-en-es0045649.008\" class=\"semb x_xd1 hasSn\"><span class=\"gp x_xdh sn ty_label tg_semb\">2 </span><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span class=\"lg\"><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">(</span><span class=\"fld\">Aviation</span><span class=\"gp tg_lg\">) </span></span><span class=\"co\"><span class=\"gp tg_co\">‹</span>attempt<span class=\"gp tg_co\">, </span></span><span class=\"co\">flight<span class=\"gp tg_co\">› </span></span><span d:def=\"2\" class=\"trans\">en solitario <d:def></d:def></span></span></span></span><span id=\"e_b-en-es0045649.009\" class=\"gramb x_xd0 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"gp sn ty_label tg_gramb\">C </span><span d:pos=\"3\" class=\"ps\">adverb <d:pos></d:pos></span></span><span id=\"e_b-en-es0045649.010\" class=\"semb x_xd1\"><span class=\"trg x_xd2\"><span d:def=\"3\" class=\"trans\">en solitario <d:def></d:def></span></span><span class=\"exg x_xd2 hasSn\"><span class=\"x_xdh\"><span class=\"sn\">▸ </span><span class=\"ex\">to fly <span class=\"rf\">solo </span></span></span><span class=\"trg x_xd3\"><span class=\"trans\">volar en solitario </span></span></span></span></span></d:entry></body></html>\n",
    "text": "solo | AmE ˈsoʊˌloʊ, BrE ˈsəʊləʊ | A noun (plural solos) 1 countable solo (masculine) ▸ a solo for piano un solo para piano▸ a violin solo un solo de violín▸ a piano solo un solo de piano▸ to perform a solo ejecutar un solo 2 uncountable solo whist whist (masculine) (en el que cada uno de los cuatro jugadores se enfrenta a los otros tres) B adjective 1 (Music) ‹violin, voices› solista ‹album› en solitario ‹piece› para voz solista, para instrumento solista ▸ to go solo lanzarse como solista 2 (Aviation) ‹attempt, flight› en solitario C adverb en solitario ▸ to fly solo volar en solitario "
  },
