    "text": "sólo adverb only ▸ trabaja sólo por las mañanas he only works in the mornings▸ trabaja solo por las mañanas he works by himself in the mornings The Real Academia Española recommends the use of the unaccented form except in cases of ambiguity in the use of the adjective and the adverb "
